## Out-of-scope observations

- Runtime behavior was not exercised because the review scope explicitly prohibits reading or running tests and prohibits provider/Docker execution. This verdict is based on the supplied exact patch and direct production-source contract tracing.
- Already-terminal journals with a missing role completion remain intentionally immutable. The fix can settle recoverable ledger state but cannot make such a journal cardinality-verifiable without an explicit repair/migration; it now reports that condition accurately rather than claiming automatic repair.
- End-to-end production validation still depends on genuine campaign manifest, baseline, provider, and execution authorities. That existing integration dependency is unchanged by this fix.
